WEBVTT

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:05.033
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> In Qatar, you can take the driving test when you’re 14.

00:00:06.984 --> 00:00:14.094
In some states in Mexico, you only need to take a theory test, not a practical test.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:23.271
In Vietnam, it’s very difficult to pass the theory test. It has 450 questions!

00:00:25.271 --> 00:00:32.210
In Croatia, you need to have 85 hours of driving lessons before you take the practical test.

00:00:34.038 --> 00:00:39.781
In Ukraine, if you do two things wrong in your practical test, you fail.

00:00:41.669 --> 00:00:49.137
In Brazil, after your driving test, you need to pass a psychological test to get your driving license.